-- WHAT THIS DOES
--   Inserts domain_events (orders/paid, orders/sync, orders/fulfilled)
--   for 18 orders. These replay via `npm run rebuild` through
--   processDomainEvent -> constraints/age/revenue + shopOperationalSnapshot
--   -> AL-01 alerts aggregator. A later brief force-refresh renders them.
--
-- COHORTS (calibrated to verified constraint rules; SLA = 24h)
--   A. Fulfilled history   x10  (-55d..-3d)  FULFILLED   -> revenue history
--   B. Fresh ready-to-ship  x4  (-12h..-22h) UNFULFILLED -> "Ready to ship", no breach
--   C. Aged breach          x3  (-3d..-5d)   UNFULFILLED -> operational + sla_breach + revenue_at_risk
--   D. Missing-cogs          x1  (-2d)        UNFULFILLED -> missing_cogs (zero-cost variant)
--
-- SAFETY
--   - domain_events is append-only; re-running duplicates rows unless
--     external_event_id collides (UNIQUE on shop_id+external_event_id).
--     All ids below are prefixed 9000xx so they will NOT collide with
--     existing data, and WILL collide on a second run (idempotent insert).
--   - Wrapped so a second run is a no-op via ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING.
-- ============================================================

